5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Since we need to decide on our destination, I think we should look into the logistics first. I'll check ""Time alone in the shared-house year"" and ""How last year's days ran"" to help us plan the atmosphere.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"That sounds like a wonderful start, Mizuki. I would like to look into ""All-in rates against meals bought separately"" and ""What separately booked rooms cost last time"" to see how we might handle the expenses fairly.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
