60,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Looking at our discussion, the city break seems to offer the best balance of personal space and travel efficiency, which addresses the issues we've had in previous years. I vote for Option C.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"I agree that the city break provides the most freedom for everyone. While I worry about the costs being uneven, the comfort of our friends is more important. I also vote for Option C.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Minato,,I really like the idea of having my own room and no strict schedule. It sounds like the most relaxing choice for me. I vote for Option C.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,The city break is the only option that doesn't waste our precious time on travel and gives us the peace we need. I vote for Option C.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Midori,,"I'm still a bit worried about the unpredictable costs, but seeing how much everyone prefers the city for their peace of mind, I'll support the group. I vote for Option C.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Since we have all reached a consensus on Option C, it seems we have found the best solution for this year. I'm glad we could prioritize everyone's comfort and time.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shizue,,It is a relief that we have all found a way to agree. I look forward to a wonderful trip where everyone feels at ease and happy.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Minato,,I'm really happy we chose the city. I feel much better knowing I'll have my own space to relax and sleep. I can't wait to go!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,I am glad we could find a destination that respects everyone's needs. A city break will allow us to enjoy each other's company without the exhaustion of long travel. I look forward to it.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Midori,,I'm happy we've decided together. Let's just make sure we talk about the budget and how to handle the payments early on so there are no surprises. I'm looking forward to it!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Since we have a unanimous decision, I believe we can conclude our discussion here. I'll help coordinate the initial budget talk to ensure Midori and Shizue feel secure about the costs.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
