76,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. It is a relief to have a plan that ensures we all return home feeling refreshed. I am looking forward to the trip.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
